// 005.11, 011.14: a piece of evidence is identified by the fact, its polarity, and who tendered
// it. An act tenders in the name of its actor unless `By` names another. `Retracts e` withdraws
// this source's supporting evidence and `Retracts !e` its contrary evidence.
Fact physician Identified by DrAdler, DrBose
Fact clerk Identified by Clerk
Evidenced Bool lacks
Act determine Actor physician Holds when True Supports lacks()
Act doubt Actor physician Holds when True Rebuts lacks()
Act withdraw Actor physician Holds when True Retracts lacks()
Act withdraw-doubt Actor physician Holds when True Retracts !lacks()
Act file-report Actor clerk Related to physician Holds when True Supports lacks() By physician
.
determine(DrAdler). determine(DrBose).
?Established(lacks()).
withdraw(DrAdler).
?Established(lacks()).
withdraw(DrBose).
?Unresolved(lacks()).
file-report(Clerk, DrAdler).
doubt(DrBose).
?Conflicted(lacks()).
withdraw-doubt(DrBose).
?Established(lacks()).
withdraw(DrAdler).
?Unresolved(lacks()).
